le image is fine too 👍\n\nReferences: https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1Am6V1EkJ7vr6XVfbsdCsV0O2sW65vrGL", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@shqueq/works/13", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2048180, "client_id": 2857386, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/ecf4c1c9/uploads/origins/c3791c74-f4a0-47c7-a0dd-3a16c33839fb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=74fd348b434974f2c90ed1d2a450be56", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ecf4c1c9/uploads/origins/c3791c74-f4a0-47c7-a0dd-3a16c33839fb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=74fd348b434974f2c90ed1d2a450be56, https://si.imgix.net/ecf4c1c9/uploads/origins/c3791c74-f4a0-47c7-a0dd-3a16c33839fb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f12c06d05076ba55ab25e66e968cd100 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ecf4c1c9/uploads/origins/c3791c74-f4a0-47c7-a0dd-3a16c33839fb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=398082d60c5e2744018761ebd99eb4ff 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/ecf4c1c9/uploads/origins/c3791c74-f4a0-47c7-a0dd-3a16c33839fb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=1859bd167ca2245a67a3590a319266d0", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ecf4c1c9/uploads/origins/c3791c74-f4a0-47c7-a0dd-3a16c33839fb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=1859bd167ca2245a67a3590a319266d0, https://si.imgix.net/ecf4c1c9/uploads/origins/c3791c74-f4a0-47c7-a0dd-3a16c33839fb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=9af6f91f4cfbca3aae753fad79140e8b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ecf4c1c9/uploads/origins/c3791c74-f4a0-47c7-a0dd-3a16c33839fb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f5b83b2c342f2915cb99abf38718b9bc 3x"}, "body": "Hello,\n\nI would like to commission artwork of my OC, Kaede (reference sheet link attached).\n\nAs the weather rapidly moves into autumn, the cool winds blow, and the leaves begin to change here it brings thoughts of far away places.  I would like Kaede tending to a small shrine, in traditional Miko's garb.\n\nhttps://x.com/OkamiMaiku/status/1678428938132164612", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@shqueq/works/12", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2048180, "client_id": 1417927, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b2471d44/uploads/origins/de8926fa-ce53-4119-bbef-d86a96c97e8b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d0fc45037ab08e85c3714e1f05ae0801", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b2471d44/uploads/origins/de8926fa-ce53-4119-bbef-d86a96c97e8b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d0fc45037ab08e85c3714e1f05ae0801, https://si.imgix.net/b2471d44/uploads/origins/de8926fa-ce53-4119-bbef-d86a96c97e8b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c19267988198c14662d2d004d6f63c09 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b2471d44/uploads/origins/de8926fa-ce53-4119-bbef-d86a96c97e8b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a34a5b1f4ba1329b81e3ae048170e1fd 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b2471d44/uploads/origins/de8926fa-ce53-4119-bbef-d86a96c97e8b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=efcfa7d9832a1f418531cd5b1119e471", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b2471d44/uploads/origins/de8926fa-ce53-4119-bbef-d86a96c97e8b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=efcfa7d9832a1f418531cd5b1119e471, https://si.imgix.net/b2471d44/uploads/origins/de8926fa-ce53-4119-bbef-d86a96c97e8b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=76fadbe42ae440db09281e19fa8e3e0b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b2471d44/uploads/origins/de8926fa-ce53-4119-bbef-d86a96c97e8b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c3c6847a934e03caebf483747d3e57c4 3x"}, "body": "Good evening Shqueq!　I want to entrust you with one of my most precious illustrations.\nI want you to draw an illustration of Anne, Rita and Greer in a hot spring.\nThe location is a volcanic area in Greer's hometown, and Anne, Rita and Greer are bathing in a hot spring that was naturally formed there, with towels wrapped around their bodies.\nIt is nighttime, and the hot springs are reflecting the night sky with stars. Please give us a beautiful illustration of the three of them looking up at the beautiful starry sky.\n\nPose, placement, starry sky, and hot spring should be based on the illustration in \"General View & Placement\".\nEach of the three has a designated image for facial expressions. Please refer to those.\nPlace Anne on the left, Grea in the middle, and Rita on the right.\nAll three are smiling happily.\n\nPlease help us again.\nPlease take care of the three of us.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/18vWep_a8lb0Hv3sjYi8_9NP1lXdmtgJv?usp=sharing", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@shqueq/works/11", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2048180, "client_id": 1748328, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/ff6871d4/uploads/origins/e3b3cdae-daec-4f46-8ceb-486e77440872?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=91c16a8da777f551e01e8