ne, Rita, and Greer at the bakery.\n\nAn illustration of a bakery run by three people in designated outfits, working inside the bakery.\nAnne and Rita have changed their hairstyles. The clothes are matching uniforms of different colors.\nPlease leave the background to the interior of the bakery.\n\nRita:.\nShe is holding freshly baked bread with tongs and arranging it.\nShe looks as if she is hungry and wants to eat the bread.\nShe looks happy.\n\nAnne: Holding a tray of bread in her hands.\nShe is holding a tray with bread on it in both hands and is receiving Rita's bread on the tray.\nShe is looking at Rita with a smile and looks very cheerful and happy.\n\nGreer:.\nShe is in the back compared to the other two. She is carrying a basket with some French bread.\nLooking at Anne and Rita, who seem to be in good spirits, Grea also looks happy.\n\nRunning a bakery with the three of us is a future dream for Rita.\nI hope to greet her with such a happy scene after my story ends someday.\nI will leave it to you to figure out what I don't understand or what is unclear.\n\nPlease do not hesitate to contact me.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1k7ofx2ftJ6T6W9gUE0P0l8slQFzFSVAt?usp=sharing", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@shqueq/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2048180, "client_id": 1748328, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/39677735/uploads/origins/43b30189-e937-479a-9a19-97026b33fdeb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3f60338548cde156757f51e4b9adf7c5", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/39677735/uploads/origins/43b30189-e937-479a-9a19-97026b33fdeb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3f60338548cde156757f51e4b9adf7c5, https://si.imgix.net/39677735/uploads/origins/43b30189-e937-479a-9a19-97026b33fdeb?bg=%23fff&aut