-tail hair and a manly personality.\nGurea: The main character in the \"Manalia Friends\" anime. She has short black hair that is slightly red. She has horns, wings, and a tail.\n\n0 Situation\nTwo people sleeping on a bed. Rita is hugging Greer from behind and smiling happily.\nGrea is shyly but shyly accepting.\nGrea's wings are folded so that she won't hurt Rita.\nRita is hugging the person she loves and smiles as if she is very relieved.\n\nzOthers\nPlease use vertical illustrations.\nWe welcome your arrangement and your interpretation of the illustration.\nWe may use your illustration as an illustration for a novel of your own creation.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1pNNov-u3ibSu7vQ7xF30PjmWMDM6ueqR?usp=sharing", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 239, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "すねいる", "screen_name": "snail8maimai", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1215703106840748032/MQYWrnky.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/125021441/1501049830/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "nc": 128}, {"id": 305084, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "うそつきまんじゅう", "screen_name": "usotuki_mannjyu", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1914996361231224832/DMh5eIpT.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/4614884000/1699298031/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "nc"